  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak. Set aside.\n• Thinly slice red onion (see ingredients). Finely chop garlic.\n• In a small bowl, combine the white wine vinegar and a good pinch of sugar and salt.\n• Scrunch sliced onion in your hands, then add to pickling liquid. Add enough water to just cover onion. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f836950d0527cba53a59ae/step-0d232100.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a medium saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook pearl couscous and garlic, stirring occasionally, until golden and fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Carefully add the water, currants and a pinch of salt. Reduce heat to medium, then simmer, stirring occasionally, until couscous is tender and water is absorbed, 10-12 minutes. Remove from heat and set aside to cool.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f836950d0527cba53a59ae/step-f2647610.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While couscous is cooking, halve snacking tomatoes.\n• Roughly chop Qukes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f836950d0527cba53a59ae/step-642fcc20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f836950d0527cba53a59ae/step-2f37eb30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain pickled onion.\n• To the couscous, add snacking tomatoes, kalamata olives, Qukes, pickled onion, spinach & rocket mix (see ingredients) and a drizzle of olive oil. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f836950d0527cba53a59ae/step-1aae7f40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide pearl couscous salad between bowls.\n• Top with Greek-style haloumi and drizzle with creamy pesto dressing to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f836950d0527cba53a59ae/step-3e90c050.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
